metric-city/main/public/readme-image.png","text","mediaReviewed","截图来源核查","value","2026-10-20","language","en","image","gameplay","The creator’s panoramic city view, preserved in full with padding.","src","/GameMap/media/learning/isocity-cursor.webp","alt","A dense isometric city around a blue harbour, with streets, waterfront buildings and green parks.","https://github.com/amilich/isometric-city#readme","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","Creator-published screenshot","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型",[92],"Cursor","创作者开发记录",[97],"evidence","section",{"_61":98,"_25":81,"_99":100},"查看作者的 AI 使用说明","note","Author README presents both IsoCity and IsoCoaster together and directly names Cursor. Source-checked; full reproduction not performed.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[105],{"_61":106,"_25":107,"_99":108},"查看完整游戏项目","https://github.com/amilich/isometric-city","Complete Next.js/TypeScript game with renderer, simulation, UI and public assets; npm install then npm run dev opens the city at localhost:3000. Current package uses Next 16; use a compatible current Node runtime. MIT code.","获取方式","playable","demo","试玩与运行",[114],{"_61":115,"_25":116,"_99":117},"Play IsoCity","https://iso-city.com","Author-hosted browser city builder with pointer and touch support.","游戏平台","浏览器","指南形式","disclosure","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[125],{"_61":126,"_25":81,"_99":-7},"阅读作者的开发说明","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[131,132,133,134],"Play the city builder and follow how roads, zoning and utilities affect growth.","Run the repository locally and locate the CanvasIsometricGrid renderer and city state.","Trace one system, such as train routing, pedestrian paths or the economy, from input to visible behavior.","Change one simulation rule with an agent, then compare its behavior and save/load flow with the original.","AI 工作流与开发背景","作者明确将 Cursor 列为开发工具，但没有公开模型名称、代码生成比例或完整提示记录。可以把它作为 AI 辅助城市建造项目，研究渲染、状态与模拟之间的衔接。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","2D","track","metada